---
import ContentLayout from "@/layouts/ContentLayout.astro";
import { siteConfig } from "@/config/site";
const c = siteConfig.claims;
---

<ContentLayout
  title="About Dubai Battery Service | How It Works"
  description="Dubai Battery Service connects drivers with a vetted 24/7 mobile battery team across Dubai. Who does the work, how requests work, and our standards."
  path="/about/"
  crumbs={[
    { name: "Home", path: "/" },
    { name: "About", path: "/about/" },
  ]}
  eyebrow="About us"
  h1="About Dubai Battery Service"
  lead="A simple way for drivers in Dubai to get a dead car battery sorted — fast, at their location, with the right battery for their car."
>
  <h2>What we do</h2>
  <p>
    {siteConfig.siteName} is a Dubai car battery help service. When your car won't start, you message or call, and a
    mobile technician comes to wherever the car is parked to jump start, test or replace the battery. Our guides and price
    information are written to help drivers make a good decision — even if they never contact us.
  </p>

  <h2>Who carries out the work</h2>
  <p>
    Requests made through this website are handled by an independent, vetted Dubai mobile battery team. They carry out
    the work, supply the batteries and provide the warranty. We work with them because they meet the standards below —
    and we'd rather tell you that plainly than pretend otherwise.
  </p>

  <h2>The standards every job should meet</h2>
  <ul>
    {c.is24x7 && <li><strong>Available 24/7</strong> — nights, weekends and public holidays.</li>}
    {c.responseTime && <li><strong>Fast arrival</strong> — typically {c.responseTime} in Dubai, traffic permitting.</li>}
    {c.freeTesting && <li><strong>Test before replacing</strong> — the battery and alternator are checked for free, so you only pay for a battery you need.</li>}
    <li><strong>The correct battery for your car</strong> — type, capacity and size matched to your make and model, with registration where required.</li>
    {c.warranty && <li><strong>Real warranty</strong> — {c.warranty.toLowerCase()}, depending on brand and size.</li>}
    <li><strong>Price agreed first</strong> — confirmed on WhatsApp before the technician sets off.</li>
    <li><strong>Responsible disposal</strong> — old batteries are taken away for recycling.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>How a request works</h2>
  <ol>
    <li>You message on WhatsApp or call, with your car's make, model, year and location.</li>
    <li>The team confirms the right battery and the price.</li>
    <li>A technician comes to you, tests the battery and charging system, and fixes the problem on the spot.</li>
  </ol>
  <p>
    When you message through the site, the pre-filled WhatsApp text mentions that you found the service here. It never
    includes personal data — you choose what to share.
  </p>

  <h2>Questions or feedback</h2>
  <p>
    If something about a job wasn't right, tell us through the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>. Feedback helps keep
    the standard high.
  </p>
</ContentLayout>
